[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"三毛猫","text":"“喵。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，是你啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了，之前静久的东西还一直在我这里保管着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在海蟑螂应该也差不多都跑掉了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然完全没有把握……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望它们已经不在了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一边这么想着，一边朝海之家走去。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i364"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13763"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在海之家前发现了静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13736"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，乳依里♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"称呼又变回乳依里了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她大概是想表示亲近才这么叫的吧……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我把你的那些行李带过来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13779"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢你呀，帮大忙了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她一边说着，一边拿着钥匙插进门锁。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13779"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13906"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……不知道为什么，一想到要开门，手就开始抖个不停呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我知道是怎么回事……就是那个吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大量的海蟑螂爬上静久的手的那件事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“希望不会像上次那样。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“上次……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“海蟑螂哗啦一下全冒出来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“海蟑螂哗啦一下!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对啊，然后沙沙地爬上了静久的手。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13916"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“爬上我的手!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"光是在一旁看着，就足以构成心理阴影级别的事件。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……我不记得了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……看来对她来说，是一件想从记忆中抹去的事情啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以后还是别提了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，我来开门吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，我打开了门……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“打扰了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虫子已经彻底消失了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看起来没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13812"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“太好了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久也走了进来。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13784"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“真是的……都是因为你提到了那么可怕的事情，我都开始心慌了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13863"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i382"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久环视着店内。"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":32},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13951"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这里一点都没变呢……虽然有点脏脏的就是了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她怀念地摸了摸附近的桌子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就开始打扫吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13736"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，谢谢你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们开始清理积灰，将店内整体擦拭了一遍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里只是单纯没人使用而已，看上去并没有东西摆得到处都是，或者食物烂掉之类的情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久仔细地……带着怀念的心情擦拭着每一个地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟她也说过，这里是个重要的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你以前经常来这里吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13739"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……这里是我的栖身之处。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13848"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不，或许该说是避难所才对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13769"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当我心情难过，或者莫名不想待在家里的时候……我就会来到海之家。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13854"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“在这里一直能听到海浪声，十分宁静。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13918"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过岛上的人们会来这家店吃咖喱，所以也不会觉得寂寞。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13831"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎么说呢，是个能让人感到心平气和的地方。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13819"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是我最喜欢的地方……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":32},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13958"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“所以我才会想，如果海之家能再次迎来客人就好了……”"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，我们把店内打扫干净了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在最后，把窗户和门都大敞开来，让空气和阳光照进室内。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，打扫得还挺干净的♪　这样的话应该可以做咖喱了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，辛苦了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可能是因为本来就保持得很整洁，厨房的清洁工作很快就完成了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的话，应该就可以做些饭菜了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那个，我想请你吃咖喱作为谢礼，你觉得怎么样？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然好啊，怎么会有人拒绝咖喱呢。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":132,"value":["!=",["v",6003],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“再说我最近一直在吃炒饭，偶尔也想换换口味。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13938"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嘘……在岛上这样说炒饭的话，可是会被驱逐出境的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的假的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这岛还真是了不得啊。"},{"op":"goto","target":132},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13902"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊，不过……衣服都沾满灰尘了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“虽然带了围裙，但是穿着这身衣服做饭果然还是不太合适呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那要不改天吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不用，以防万一我带了套替换的衣服，等会换上那件就好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道她连校服都带来了吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊，没有福神渍了，可以帮我去买一下吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好说，没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13959"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“小卖铺里有卖的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小卖铺还卖福神渍啊……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你好――”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“来了～什么嘛，是你啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12190"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哟！来买东西啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，有人拜托我来买福神渍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那就是来光顾的客人呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过说是有人拜托……是镜子阿姨吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“如果是那样的话，我就暂时不靠近你家那一带了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个人可能你们也认识，是一个叫静久的女生拜托我的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15036"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“什么!؟这是怎么回事！这到底是怎么回事!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15024"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“为什么她没有来拜托我……这是为什么啊鹰原!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为你当时根本就不在场吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10181"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎～原来你认识水织学姐啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15021"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“而、而且还是能直呼名字的关系!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15015"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不、不对……也许那只是你单方面这样称呼她罢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15033"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“如果是这样的话，虽然你还是有些失礼……但姑且可以原谅。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过她倒是也叫我羽依里就是了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15027"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你说什么!؟这种事情怎么可以原谅！”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15036"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不，这绝对不能被原谅!!是这样吧？乒乓球之神！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10318"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“能不能别在店门口跟你那独特的神明对话啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……我不能叫她静久吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我将视线转向苍和良一。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10118"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你应该明白的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“看天善的态度就该察觉到了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，哦……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“顺便说一下，水织学姐可是我们学校的学生会长哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎哎哎哎哎!؟她吗!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15036"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你这家伙！直呼水织学姐的名字不说，居然还对她表示怀疑……你到底都在看她哪里啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15027"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你的眼睛是白长的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过也确实啊……感觉她头脑转得很快，而且待人态度也很温和……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果是这样的话，应该会是个很不错的会长吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15030"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“哼！对吧对吧！而且还有那样的美貌！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10319"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15041"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你在得意个什么劲啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“不过没想到你能注意到这些，真是慧眼识珠啊……鹰原。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10311"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你这家伙的情绪已经……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过听他这么一说，确实感觉静久是这样的人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10389"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“而且她成绩也很好，还很会照顾别人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15029"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“嗯，确实如此。我也经常麻烦她照顾来着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“同学也经常把我叫做‘麻烦的人’。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10413"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“这可不是在夸你啊……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15021"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“像她这样的人……为什么会和鹰原……互相用名字称呼啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15036"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“发生了什么！为什么会这样!؟我该怎么做才能让她叫我天善!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之就是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……发生了很多事情？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15027"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“完全没有增加任何有用信息啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"叫她名字，是因为吞噬满月之乳房这个称呼实在太过羞耻了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，跟他们说明这件事同样也很羞耻。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毕竟还得把乳依里也一并说出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……我和她就是偶然碰到的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后就聊到了她想要重建海之家，开咨询室之类的事情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为我也闲着没事，就去帮忙打扫卫生了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10303"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哦！原来是这样啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10396"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“水织学姐真的是个好人，你可别给她添太多麻烦啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明白。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，刚刚提到的咨询室……是打算在海之家开的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好像是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“明明在放暑假，她还是这么勤奋啊～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在学校的时候也有做类似的事吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯。学生想找人倾诉的时候，就会去学生会室找她。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“虽然她并不是主动想要做这件事的，但因为很受欢迎，大家就自然而然地过去找她了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“据说她可是除了色色方面的咨询，什么烦恼都能解决的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这很厉害啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“色色方面的烦恼解决不了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯，绝对行不通。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10405"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我之前也找她稍微咨询过一些小问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10416"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“但是聊到一半，她就满脸通红得一句话都说不出来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍，原来你会在学校里咨询色色的事情啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10138"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊啊啊――！自己挖坑自己跳了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10208"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“话说回来，你关注的重点不对吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但就是很在意嘛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，总觉得有些怪怪的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"居然跟她聊不了色色的话题吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是，她说话的时候不是经常夹杂着奶子这样的字眼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哈？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10258"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎……你说她会夹杂着什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“奶子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10340"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12148"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“奶子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12151"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15018"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“奶子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15042"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“奶子。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10413"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你在说什么啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……没有啊，就是她有时会突然聊起来奶子的话题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“那个人怎么可能会说这种话啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“肯定是你听错了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“就是因为你脑子里总想着些奇怪的事情，才会听错的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“你还好意思说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然感觉有些真的不是我听错了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10231"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说到底，夹杂着奶子是什么意思？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10210"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“如果要说夹不夹的话，奶子应该是用来夹的一方才对吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“要用来夹什么啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎……!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“被夹住的到底是什么东西？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什、什么东西……就是那个……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10402"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……对、对了，你要买福神渍来着！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10218"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你是来帮人买东西的吧？不快点回去的话，水织学姐会等不及的哦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……？哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之先买了福神渍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后回到了海之家。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i364"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"奶子是用来夹的那边……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“到底要夹什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回来的时候，空气中已经飘起了咖喱的香味。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，欢迎回来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“才刚刚炖上，所以还得再等一会儿才能做好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，需要我帮什么忙吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1591"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1589"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不用，没关系的。非要说的话，大概可以帮我尝尝味道？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，哦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“突、突然就换上了泳装，所以稍微有点吃惊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1590"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“毕竟之前穿的衣服都沾满灰尘了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"穿着泳装做菜……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是大胆的打扮啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1592"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因为除此之外也没有其他能穿的了。而且不系围裙的话，被溅到的话又会很烫。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“乍一看，还挺像裸体围裙的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1593"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“裸、裸体――!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“真是的……虽然知道男孩子对这种事感兴趣也是正常的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“可是突然说这种话……我会害羞的啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？啊！对不起！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1594"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……没、没关系。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她果然不擅长色色的话题啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……明明时不时就会自然地说出奶子二字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还以为这种话题是没什么问题的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然她其实并没有说过奶子吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说回来，闻起来真的好香啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我接过静久递过来的小碟子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"尝了一口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这完全不像是海之家会有的咖喱，太好吃了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"提到海之家的咖喱，我总觉得是那种更敷衍一点的东西……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉！能尝出来各种各样的香料味道……但加在一起又很和谐！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1595"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这完全可以收钱卖啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊，原来就是要收钱的嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说起来是这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一说，岛上好像也看到过一些小摊之类的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然不太清楚营业许可那档子的事情，但感觉销路应该会蛮不错的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“果然不要免费请人吃了，还是当作商品来卖比较好吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1589"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你还真是固执啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1592"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“在这个岛上……有人愿意花钱买炒饭，但没人愿意花钱买咖喱……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这座岛对炒饭的热爱真是恐怖……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14045"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，能帮我把这个端过去吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从静久手中接过咖喱，端到桌子那边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……香味真是太诱人了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14048"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我们开始吃吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我开动了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14046"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，请用吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"尝了一口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……好吃。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“实在是太好吃了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14057"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢♪　还可以再添一盘哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喔！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"恰到好处的辣味让人汗流不止，真是一份充满夏天气息的咖喱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"猪肉的柔软程度也刚刚好，很有嚼劲。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13990"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊呜……嗯，真好吃♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真不愧是招牌菜啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13977"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊……抱歉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13981"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这其实不是那个咖喱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14048"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这只是我当作练习试做的，是我自创的口味。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？是这样啊。不过已经很好吃了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14032"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢♪　不过，我们店真正的咖喱，可不仅仅是这种程度哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14023"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这家店的……这座岛的招牌咖喱……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14051"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“其名为，鸡白咖喱！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸡白咖喱！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们现在吃的，就只是普通的猪肉咖喱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“正宗的其实是鸡肉咖喱吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13968"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是海鲜咖喱哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎――……!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13965"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“会用上大量产自鸟白岛的海鲜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14005"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“特别是用章鱼熬制的高汤，能带出特别棒的风味哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那颜色是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14057"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“褐色的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“完全不对吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14005"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“听说是用这座岛名字里的‘鸟’‘白’二字来命名的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这名字会让人误会的，还是改掉比较好。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i378"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“多谢款待。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14046"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不客气♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的很好吃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她自创的猪肉咖喱就已经这么好吃了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14051"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢♪　下次就来尝尝正宗的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么作为商品，还成为了招牌菜的海鲜咖喱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到底会好吃到什么程度呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"海之家已经变得相当干净了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且也可以在这里做菜了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，有些地方还是没打扫干净。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"外观也完全没动过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我有空的时候，要不要再来帮你打扫一下？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“可以吗？可是……难得放暑假呢，这样不太好吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"这是为了咖喱","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"这是为了奶子","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"突然有了这样的想法","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":541,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是为了咖喱啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14024"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“呵呵♪　你这么说我很开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14045"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“下次，我会请你吃正宗的鸡白咖喱哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我很期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“说起来，你喜欢什么样的咖喱？”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"奶油黄油咖喱","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"豆子豆蓉咖喱","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"鸡白咖喱","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":520,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大概是奶油黄油咖喱吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13994"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“连咖喱都要讲究乳脂肪，真不愧是乳依里呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我只是单纯喜欢味道……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13972"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你就是喜欢乳脂肪的味道吧，乳依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“称呼不对啊……”"},{"op":"goto","target":540},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":531,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想要豆子豆蓉咖喱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13994"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是想要打算大量摄取异黄酮对吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎，我倒是没有这个意思……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14057"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“异黄酮可以让奶子变大哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“连吃咖喱的时候都在想奶子的事，真不愧是乳依里呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这称呼也太奶子了……”"},{"op":"goto","target":540},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我真的好在意鸡白咖喱的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13987"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我很高兴哦。不过，味道每天都会变的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14060"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当然，打底的配方是固定的，但主料会使用当天捕上来的海鲜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14043"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“比起整体味道的和谐，更注重调整味道来突出食材，是一道永远都不会吃腻的海鲜杂烩咖喱呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“听起来真的很美味啊。”"},{"op":"goto","target":580},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":556,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是为了奶子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14016"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“为了奶子!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说完我自己都愣住了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"奶子是从哪里冒出来的？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13994"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是呢，那就没办法了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎哎哎哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14045"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“毕竟我能提供的也就只有咖喱和奶子了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样的话，我也很乐意帮忙哦♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯、嗯……”"},{"op":"goto","target":580},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“确实……这么说的话好像还真是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14029"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“打扫卫生也不会有工资。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事，我也不是冲着这个来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14053"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“而且还挺花时间的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事，反正我也很闲，这倒是无所谓。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“和我在一起也不会很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，这我还是很开心的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那这样的话，我去一下也不是不行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么我不去呢……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稍微想了想。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像想明白了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这里果然还是会出现那种爬得又快又恶心的虫子吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14003"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊……你是讨厌海蟑螂啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……好像是这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那个场景难以忘怀。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事，今天应该不会有了，我来帮忙吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14033"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，谢谢。”"},{"op":"add","variable":7126,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i364"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13987"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，今天就忙活到这里吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，确实收拾得差不多了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14037"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我收拾完就去锁门了……再见啦♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那道咖喱……真的是太美味了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……香料也很刺激。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还有……泳装围裙也是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鹰原羽依里！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我甩掉杂念。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":607,"value":["!=",["v",6003],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等回头不想吃炒饭的时候……就再去一趟吧。"},{"op":"goto","target":608},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等回头想吃咖喱的时候，就再去一趟吧。"},{"op":"set","variable":425,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]